<title>UK: RESEARCH-ALERT CSFB upgrades Pathe to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH-ALERT CSFB upgrades Pathe to hold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Credit Suisse First Boston on Tuesday upgraded its recommendation on shares in Pathe to a &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; and said its price target for the stock was the low FF1,300's in the next 12 months.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
